---
// The Great Decoupling as two household balance sheets. Concept after Shapiro, Labor Zero (2026), plates 1–2; drawing ours.
const after = [
  ['Universal basic income', 0.9],
  ['Public wealth-fund dividends', 0.9],
  ['Collectively owned assets', 0.9],
  ['Personal assets', 0.9],
  ['Residual wages', 0.35],
];
---
<figure class="infographic">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 720 330" role="img" aria-labelledby="dc-title dc-desc">
    <title id="dc-title">The Great Decoupling</title>
    <desc id="dc-desc">Today a household's income comes mainly from wages for work. In a post-labor economy it would come mainly from ownership and transfers, with wages as a small residual.</desc>
    <g class="ig-panel">
      <text x="170" y="28" class="ig-h">Today: wage-based</text>
      <rect x="40" y="52" width="260" height="56" rx="8" class="ig-box" />
      <text x="170" y="86" class="ig-t">Work (time sold to an employer)</text>
      <path d="M170 110 V150" class="ig-arrow" marker-end="url(#dc-ah)" />
      <rect x="40" y="152" width="260" height="56" rx="8" class="ig-box ig-strong" />
      <text x="170" y="186" class="ig-t">Wages</text>
      <path d="M170 210 V250" class="ig-arrow" marker-end="url(#dc-ah)" />
      <rect x="70" y="252" width="200" height="56" rx="28" class="ig-home" />
      <text x="170" y="286" class="ig-t ig-b">Household</text>
    </g>
    <path d="M330 170 H390" class="ig-arrow ig-big" marker-end="url(#dc-ah)" />
    <g class="ig-panel">
      <text x="555" y="28" class="ig-h">Post-labor: capital-based</text>
      {after.map(([label, o], i) => (
        <g opacity={o}>
          <rect x={410} y={50 + i * 38} width={290} height={30} rx="6" class="ig-box ig-strong" />
          <text x={555} y={70 + i * 38} class="ig-t">{label}</text>
        </g>
      ))}
      <path d="M555 242 V250" class="ig-arrow" marker-end="url(#dc-ah)" />
      <rect x="455" y="252" width="200" height="56" rx="28" class="ig-home" />
      <text x="555" y="286" class="ig-t ig-b">Household</text>
    </g>
    <defs>
      <marker id="dc-ah" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="8" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto-start-reverse">
        <path d="M0 0 L10 5 L0 10 z" class="ig-ahead" />
      </marker>
    </defs>
  </svg>
  <figcaption>
    The Great Decoupling, as Post-Labor Economics frames it: household income shifts from wages to ownership and transfers.
    Concept after David Shapiro, <a href="https://daveshap.github.io/PostLaborEconomics/laborzero/"><cite>Labor Zero</cite></a> (2026), plates 1–2; drawing ours (CC BY 4.0).
  </figcaption>
</figure>
